    {
      "uid": "zhcn:621eb016bfe613c58834a775",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不、即使如此……拜托您了。\n请让我以赢下『有马纪念』为目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93ba59d2b0048815252c8f730223422e6adb01fa72feb6f992d1ca4937084f40",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
