    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1a604cf911dacba9b84ae63",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在那里，我要创造出更宏大的圆环――\n请助我完成新的使命。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf7884c662ee1c91ea4d4f7cfe698080a114fbbd09324b3e8f82a7e9da75d92d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143307.json",
