        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/104/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac7594e0fb20d5c1b3c97cbf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "突如其来的大舞台之路。\n话虽如此……对她来说，\n无论是参赛还是取胜都绝非遥不可及的梦吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2549e2f180da542aec16de98f14a54d9cb84d010eab6986dfb8fe739066c5303",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
