    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18137083a8b0aeabdb3ba284",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "更重要的是，如果这是实现她梦想的\n必要之物――那就只有去做了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0bb742880cae9d9238659b44d1a40619e6d396b964299eedd96399b991ba31a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
