    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b37f01659588051fba66a817",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――想要参加『有马纪念』、缔造更宏大的圆环\n要做的事情可太多了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53bbc802ab9e368c3ff3f4b885ab358200a28403f9c097e889faba99f258be5e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        108,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/108/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cb3fe4c4df1c23fcc6070da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "先参加一场大型比赛吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "13628cb244fdb08962678838dfd839edca72bdff888304b2bccecb803cf77cde",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        109,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/109/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da14362d84cd71d5113e7757",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "提升实力自不必说，还需要通过人气投票\n获取参赛权，以及像这次的『日本德比』一样\n铺垫好世间的高期待吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "7063600a3a60ea7349c6da0a70fd5d3d6260603b4c01156ab73bcb2be6c6b867",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        109,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/109/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a5851d00f6d11186eecc59c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "欢呼声四起。那声音\n像是包含着惊讶与困惑的爆发――\n\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "791f356e34dae1c4e0ffee25fa555eda86c90f76abed56dda8aea5e413f70ca9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddab8f14956d9b9d7225b3a1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为此参加『菊花赏』也是一种选择――\n但若想提高知名度，不限世代的比赛更好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbad14b5b03e3b0fd495f3feb83f8820986eadb70d61f2ae81f9779f510ff827",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        110,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/110/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55626dbeb1674b1fe6ee1132",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "国内……不，国外的强者也会云集的，\n比赛本身就极具话题性的比赛――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d9ec5e2ba032f835d1bb3beead508d0672710cbb921e2ea822ea9894651a74",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        111,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/111/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:928fd5982e628e40a858c65f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比萨胜驹",
      "source_fingerprint": "9beb50d57d7703a64ba6e9d70094d69e3edf1f53654ce1b6055f0ddd7c2b63d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143307.json",
